"""English/Chinese manuscript additions grounded in completed replication outputs."""
RESULT_HEADING=('Execution mechanisms recur across workload traces and market years','执行机制在不同工作负载轨迹与市场年份中复现')
RESULT_PARAS=[(
"We test the execution mechanisms with the official Frontier 2024 and 2025 workload records,^16^ paired counterfactually with the corresponding NYISO market years. The replication uses earliest service, published-price myopic and persistent scheduling, and mixed-deadline recourse; it does not test R2 in 2024. A fixed normalisation gives each Frontier year the primary Eagle-2025 total of 2,981.607 MWh of variable IT service. The registered Eagle date mapping remains unchanged, yielding 3,006.507 MWh in 2024. Comparisons therefore use each trace’s own earliest-service cost rather than assuming identical absolute baselines.",
"我们采用 Frontier 2024 与 2025 官方工作负载记录，^16^ 将其与对应 NYISO 市场年份进行反事实配对，检验执行机制。复现包括尽早执行、按已公布价格进行的短视与持续预约调度，以及混合截止时间重排；不在 2024 年测试 R2。固定归一化使每个 Frontier 年份具有与主实验 Eagle-2025 相同的 2,981.607 MWh 可变 IT 服务。Eagle 已登记的日期映射保持不变，2024 年对应 3,006.507 MWh。因此，比较使用每条轨迹自身的尽早执行成本，不假设绝对基线相同。"),(
"The physical floor changes with arrival structure (Fig. 6a): it is 5.75 h and 6.5 h for Eagle in 2024 and 2025, versus 4 h and 3 h for the corresponding Frontier traces. Under the matched 12 h contract, persistent Published-DA scheduling saves 3.97%, 7.17%, 5.66% and 7.61% relative to earliest service, respectively (Fig. 6b). Its increments over hedged myopic execution range from US$2,099 to US$3,945, or 5.0–22.5% of persistent-policy saving (Fig. 6c). All these 12 h schedules meet their deadlines.",
"物理服务下限随到达结构变化（图 6a）：Eagle 在 2024、2025 年分别为 5.75 和 6.5 小时，对应 Frontier 轨迹分别为 4 和 3 小时。匹配的 12 小时合同下，已公布 DA 持续预约相对尽早执行分别节省 3.97%、7.17%、5.66% 和 7.61%（图 6b）。它相对带可行性保护的短视执行的增量为 US$2,099–3,945，占持续预约节省额的 5.0%–22.5%（图 6c）。这些 12 小时调度均满足截止时间。"),(
"With mixed 4/12/24 h commitments, recourse removes 0.114 MWh and 2.548 MWh of late work in the two Eagle years and 0.781 MWh in Frontier-2025, with absolute value changes no larger than US$27.38 (Fig. 6d). Frontier-2024 is already feasible without repair. Removing the myopic feasibility hedge causes late work in all four 12 h cases. Retaining the alternative recorded resource-count field changes the Frontier magnitudes but preserves the positive 12 h persistence increment and successful repair of its mixed-contract failures.",
"在混合 4/12/24 小时承诺下，重排分别消除两个 Eagle 年份的 0.114、2.548 MWh 逾期，以及 Frontier-2025 的 0.781 MWh 逾期，价值变化的绝对值均不超过 US$27.38（图 6d）。Frontier-2024 在重排之前已经可行。移除短视执行的可行性保护后，四组 12 小时案例均出现逾期。采用日志中另一种资源计数字段会改变 Frontier 结果的大小，但 12 小时持续预约增量仍为正，该口径下的混合合同逾期也均被重排消除。"),(
"Persistence is not uniformly advantageous. At 24 h in 2025, it yields US$1,827.61 less than myopic execution on Eagle and US$2,306.56 less on Frontier, despite zero late work. This reversal limits the claim to a contract- and market-dependent contribution rather than universal dominance. Complete windows, resource-field sensitivities and the observed-price 2024 tail appear in Supplementary Tables 31–38.",
"持续预约并非始终占优。2025 年 24 小时窗口下，尽管均无逾期，它在 Eagle 和 Frontier 上分别比短视执行少获得 US$1,827.61 和 US$2,306.56。这一反转将结论限定为取决于合同与市场的增量贡献，而非普遍优势。完整窗口、资源字段敏感性及采用实测价格的 2024 年末尾段见补充表 31–38。")]

METHODS=[('Independent Frontier workload replication','独立 Frontier 工作负载复现',[
("The official JSSPP Frontier archives contain 1,217,397 jobs in 2024 and 977,884 in 2025, with 21 header-defined fields.^16^ The field named required_nodes is documented as a node or core resource count; its ratio to the explicit node requirement varies across jobs. The primary proxy therefore parses the node count N from the header-defined required_properties expression frontier:excl:Nx112, which matches every record. Submissions are aggregated in 15-minute bins. Runtime, waiting time and job outcome do not weight demand; all statuses, large requests, epoch-zero submissions and zero-arrival intervals are retained. The alternative field-7 resource count is separately normalised and evaluated at 12 h and under mixed deadlines, without selecting between proxies on economic outcomes.",
"JSSPP 官方 Frontier 归档包含 2024 年 1,217,397 项任务和 2025 年 977,884 项任务，每条记录具有日志头定义的 21 个字段。^16^ 名为 required_nodes 的字段被说明为节点或核资源计数，其与明确节点请求之比在任务间不同。因此，主代理从日志头定义的 required_properties 表达式 frontier:excl:Nx112 中解析节点数 N，全部记录均匹配该格式。按提交时间聚合至十五分钟区间。运行时间、等待时间和任务结果不用于加权需求；保留全部状态、大请求、零时刻提交及零到达区间。另将第 7 字段资源计数独立归一化，在 12 小时及混合截止时间下评估，不依据经济结果选择代理。"),
("Elapsed seconds from each header’s UnixStartTime are mapped to the corresponding NYISO local-year opening. This constant five-hour UTC phase translation preserves event order and interarrival durations over the complete 366- or 365-day calendar; it is not an assertion of synchronous observations at a NYISO Frontier facility. One scalar maps annual submitted-node demand to the exact frozen Eagle-2025 service total, 2,981.607392515 MWh. The coefficients are 9.29566755×10⁻⁵ and 1.16001300×10⁻⁴ total model work units per submitted node for 2024 and 2025, respectively; work is split equally across the four equal-capacity sites. The physical floor is recomputed at 100%, 75% and 50% service capacity. PV, PUE, prices, historical fallback prices, commitment schedules and service capacities are held common between workload sources within a market year. No Frontier workload enters W1 or R2.",
"各日志相对于 UnixStartTime 的秒偏移映射至对应 NYISO 当地年度起点。这一固定五小时 UTC 相位平移在完整的 366 或 365 日历内保留事件顺序与到达间隔，并不声称存在位于 NYISO 的 Frontier 设施同步观测。每年以一个标量将全年提交节点需求映射为冻结 Eagle-2025 的精确服务总量 2,981.607392515 MWh。2024 和 2025 系数分别为每提交节点 9.29566755×10⁻⁵ 和 1.16001300×10⁻⁴ 个模型总工作单位，再平均分配至四个等容量站点。重新计算 100%、75%、50% 服务容量下的物理下限。同一市场年内，不同工作负载源共用光伏、PUE、价格、历史回退价格、采购计划及服务容量。Frontier 工作负载不输入 W1 或 R2。")]),
('Secondary 2024 market-year mechanism replay','2024 第二市场年份机制回放',[
("The secondary replay covers 1 January 2024 00:00 through 1 January 2025 00:00 America/New_York: 35,136 contiguous UTC quarter-hours across 366 local dates. Leap day contributes 96 intervals, the 10 March DST day 92, and 3 November 100. The complete official DA and integrated RT archives supply the same four zones. Dated 2024 NASA-derived PV, including the UTC boundary needed to close the local year, is used directly. PUE is rebuilt with the frozen physical twin and the same seasonal, same-weekday template rule, restricted to pre-2024 issue-legal templates. The registered Eagle target-date-to-source-date map and its training-only bridge are unchanged. Its annual service is 0.84% above the common Frontier normalisation target, a disclosed exposure difference rather than a fitted scale.",
"第二年份回放覆盖 America/New_York 时间 2024 年 1 月 1 日 00:00 至 2025 年 1 月 1 日 00:00，包含 366 个当地日期、35,136 个 UTC 连续十五分钟时段。闰日含 96 个时段，3 月 10 日夏令时切换日为 92 个，11 月 3 日为 100 个。同四分区使用完整官方 DA 和综合 RT 归档。直接使用带日期的 2024 年 NASA 派生光伏，以及完成当地年度所需的 UTC 边界。PUE 由冻结物理模型及相同的季节、星期匹配模板规则重建，候选限定为 2024 年以前且满足信息时点约束的模板。Eagle 已登记的目标日期至源日期映射及仅训练期桥接不变，其全年服务量比 Frontier 共同归一化目标高 0.84%；这是披露的工作量差异，不是重新拟合的规模。"),
("All policies within each year share the issue-time DA schedule constructed from frozen empirical workload/PV pools and capped by the connection limit. Its DA-minus-RT settlement component is included in every absolute cost and cancels in paired savings. The archived 2025 component is retained exactly; the 2024 component is generated by the same issue-load formula. The unchanged published-price provider enforces the preceding-day 11:00 availability gate and pre-2024 RT-median fallback. The original myopic, persistent and deadline-priority kernels are reused at 7/12/24 h and under the 25/50/25% mixed contract. A 48 h tail uses observed January 2025 RT prices; all evaluated 2024 12/24 h point policies already have empty closing queues. Because 2024 informed R2 stopping, calibration and selection, it is a mechanism-year replication, not an independent R2 test. No prediction model is retrained or compared on 2024 outcomes.",
"每个年份的各策略共用由冻结工作负载和光伏经验池生成、受接入上限约束的发布时点 DA 计划。其 DA 减 RT 结算贡献计入全部绝对成本，在配对节省中抵消。2025 年归档贡献精确保留，2024 年贡献采用相同的发布时点负荷公式生成。不变的已公布价格提供器执行前一日 11:00 可用性门控，以及 2024 年以前 RT 中位数回退。在 7/12/24 小时及 25/50/25% 混合合同下复用原短视、持续预约与截止时间优先内核。48 小时尾段采用 2025 年 1 月实测 RT 价格；受测的全部 2024 年 12/24 小时点策略本来就具有空期末队列。由于 2024 年参与过 R2 早停、校准与选择，本轮是机制年份复现，不是独立 R2 测试。不重训预测模型，也不在 2024 年结果上比较预测模型。")])]

DISCUSSION=(
"The 2025 calendar remains the primary locked evaluation year for R2, supplemented by a secondary 2024 execution-mechanism replay and independent Frontier workload records. The four matched 12 h comparisons support price-responsive saving and a positive persistence increment, while the 2025 24 h reversals show that persistent claims can sacrifice the value of later re-ranking. The size and direction of that trade-off depend on the contract and market. The study remains a parameterised, divisible-work counterfactual: Frontier is not co-located with NYISO, service windows are declared contracts, and the mapped arrivals are not measured facility energy. Although Frontier supplies job runtimes, this replication does not model non-preemptible execution or checkpoint behaviour. Epoch-zero submissions are retained and determine the Frontier-2025 floor, making trace-boundary semantics relevant to its numerical magnitude. Prospective, job-resolved and network-constrained validation remains necessary.",
"2025 年仍是 R2 的主要锁定评估年，另外补充 2024 年执行机制回放及独立 Frontier 工作负载记录。四组匹配的 12 小时比较支持价格响应节省与正的持续预约增量，而 2025 年 24 小时反转表明，持续容量占用也可能牺牲后续重新排序的价值。这一权衡的大小和方向取决于合同与市场。研究仍属于参数化的可分割工作反事实：Frontier 不位于 NYISO，服务窗口是声明合同，映射到达也不是设施实测能耗。虽然 Frontier 提供任务运行时长，本轮复现并不建模不可抢占执行或检查点行为。零时刻提交被完整保留，并决定 Frontier-2025 的物理下限，因此该数值还与轨迹边界语义有关。仍需具有任务细节和网络约束的前瞻验证。")

FIG_CAPTIONS={
2:("Fig. 2 | Service commitments define the physical resource. a, Released work plus opening queue, earliest service and available capacity around the largest 2025 Eagle work prefix; pale shading marks outstanding work. Capacity before release cannot be banked. b, Minimum common service window at three capacity fractions. c, Late work under common 7/12/24 h contracts; the dotted line marks the 6.5 h physical floor. Indigo denotes R2 and copper RASC; diamonds denote interval guidance. R2 uses the primary initialization. Source data are unchanged from the locked 2025 analysis.",
"图 2｜服务承诺定义物理资源。a，Eagle-2025 最大工作前缀附近的已释放工作加期初队列、尽早服务及可用容量；浅阴影表示未完成工作，释放前的容量不能储存。b，三种容量比例下的最小共同服务窗口。c，7/12/24 小时共同合同的逾期工作；点线标示 6.5 小时物理下限。靛蓝表示 R2，铜色表示 RASC；菱形表示区间指导。R2 使用主初始化。源数据保持锁定 2025 分析不变。"),
3:("Fig. 3 | Conventional operating cost and conditional market-information gains. a, Absolute service-adjusted 12 h annual costs; the dashed line is earliest service at US$555,168.21. Labels show US$ thousands and saving percentages. Myopic versus persistent DA fixes the scoring rule; RASC/R2 substitutions fix the executor. b, Post-publication RASC and R2 forecast quality; R2 points are three-seed means and whiskers are seed ranges. Tail events use pre-evaluation thresholds. c, Primary-seed R2 minus RASC point-policy savings with neutral-grey paired seven-day-block 95% intervals. The open 7 h marker denotes cases with late work; the 12 and 24 h point policies meet deadlines. These intervals quantify within-year variation.",
"图 3｜传统运行成本与条件性的市场信息增量。a，12 小时全年服务调整后绝对成本；虚线为尽早执行 US$555,168.21。标签表示千美元成本和节省率。短视与持续 DA 比较固定评分规则；RASC/R2 替换固定执行器。b，公布后 RASC 和 R2 预测质量；R2 点为三个种子均值，误差线为种子范围，尾部事件使用评估前阈值。c，主种子 R2 减 RASC 点策略节省，以及中性灰色的配对七日区块 95% 区间。7 小时空心点表示存在逾期，12、24 小时点策略满足截止时间。这些区间描述年内变异。"),
4:("Fig. 4 | Risk selection concentrates saving into fewer interventions. a, Matched 12 h saving and shifted IT energy. Indigo is R2, copper RASC and slate Published DA. Diamonds indicate interval guidance; circles or squares indicate point guidance. Marker size is constant. b, R2 interval value retained, shifted energy used and service-adjusted CVaR95 reduction relative to R2 point guidance. Absolute risk values appear in Table 1. The mechanism comparison uses seed 20260920; all-seed outcomes are retained in Supplementary Tables 20 and 22.",
"图 4｜风险筛选将节省集中于更少干预。a，匹配 12 小时合同下的节省和调节 IT 电量。靛蓝为 R2，铜色为 RASC，灰蓝为已公布 DA。菱形表示区间指导，圆点或方块表示点指导，标记大小固定。b，R2 区间策略相对 R2 点指导保留的价值、使用的调节电量，以及服务调整后 CVaR95 降幅。绝对风险值见表 1。机制比较采用种子 20260920，全部种子结果见补充表 20、22。"),
5:("Fig. 5 | Deadline priority protects service delivery. a, Mixed 4/12/24 h windows and their 25/50/25% workload shares. b, R2 interval late work before and after recourse. c, Corresponding annual electricity-cost savings; the horizontal axis is magnified to reveal the US$3.12 change. Copper denotes fixed reservations and deep indigo recourse. Only unexecuted reservations are reassigned. d, R2 interval savings at 7, 12 and 24 h, with three-seed min–max whiskers at 12 and 24 h. Every displayed interval trajectory meets its deadlines. These panels retain the frozen 2025 outcomes.",
"图 5｜截止时间优先保障服务兑现。a，混合 4/12/24 小时窗口及 25/50/25% 工作份额。b，R2 区间策略重排前后的逾期工作。c，对应全年用电成本节省；横轴刻度放大，以显示 US$3.12 变化。铜色表示固定预约，深靛蓝表示重排，只重新分配尚未执行的预约。d，R2 区间在 7、12、24 小时下的节省，12、24 小时带三个种子最小至最大误差线。所有展示的区间轨迹均满足截止时间。各面板保留冻结的 2025 年结果。"),
6:("Fig. 6 | Execution mechanisms across market years and independent workload traces. a, Workload-dependent physical floors at 100%, 75% and 50% service capacity. b, Matched 12 h savings relative to each trace/year’s earliest-service adjusted cost. c, Persistent minus hedged-myopic Published-DA saving at 12 h. d, Mixed-contract late work under fixed reservations and deadline-priority recourse; Frontier-2024 starts and remains at zero. Circle, square and triangle distinguish Eagle, Frontier-2024 and Frontier-2025; 2024 markers are open and 2025 markers filled. Frontier demand is normalised to the frozen Eagle-2025 annual service total; Eagle-2024 retains its registered mapping. These are counterfactual trace–market pairings. The 2024 panels evaluate execution mechanisms, not independent R2 generalisation. Non-positive 24 h persistence effects in 2025 are retained in Supplementary Table 33.",
"图 6｜不同市场年份与独立工作负载轨迹下的执行机制。a，100%、75%、50% 服务容量下由工作负载决定的物理下限。b，相对于各轨迹与年份自身尽早执行调整后成本的匹配 12 小时节省率。c，12 小时已公布 DA 下持续预约减带可行性保护短视执行的节省。d，固定预约与截止时间优先重排的混合合同逾期；Frontier-2024 从零开始并保持为零。圆形、方形、三角形分别区分 Eagle、Frontier-2024、Frontier-2025；2024 为空心、2025 为实心。Frontier 需求归一化至冻结 Eagle-2025 全年服务量，Eagle-2024 保留已登记映射。这些均为反事实轨迹与市场配对；2024 面板评估执行机制，不评估 R2 独立泛化。2025 年 24 小时非正持续预约增量保留于补充表 33。")}

REFERENCE='Maheshwari, K., Klusáček, D., Suter, F. & Brewer, W. Workload traces from the Frontier exascale supercomputer. In Job Scheduling Strategies for Parallel Processing, Lecture Notes in Computer Science 16980 (Springer, 2026). https://jsspp.org/workload/index.php?page=frontier25.'
